       This  page  summarizes  variables provided by the ccuurrsseess library's low-
       level terminfo interface.  A more complete description is given in  the
       ccuurrss__tteerrmmiinnffoo(3X) manual page.

       Depending  on  the  configuration,  these  may  be actual variables, or
       macros  (see  ccuurrss__tthhrreeaaddss(3X))  which  provide  read-only  access   to
       _c_u_r_s_e_s's  state.   In  either  case,  applications should treat them as
       read-only to avoid confusing the library.

