       The ttiicc(1) and iinnffooccmmpp(1) programs use lookup tables for the  long  and
       short  names  of  terminfo  capabilities,  as well as the corresponding
       names for termcap capabilities.  These are available to other  applica‐
       tions,  although the hash-tables used by the terminfo and termcap func‐
       tions are not available.

       The long terminfo capability names use a  “f”  (eff)  in  their  names:
       bboooollffnnaammeess, nnuummffnnaammeess, and ssttrrffnnaammeess.

       These  are  the  short names for terminfo capabilities: bboooollnnaammeess, nnuumm‐‐
       nnaammeess, and ssttrrnnaammeess.

       These are the corresponding names used for termcap descriptions:  bbooooll‐‐
       ccooddeess, nnuummccooddeess, and ssttrrccooddeess.

